        ['What number is C in Roman numerals?','C = 100. C comes from the Latin word "centum" meaning hundred — the same root as "century".'],
        ['What are Roman numbers 1 to 10?','I=1, II=2, III=3, IV=4, V=5, VI=6, VII=7, VIII=8, IX=9, X=10.'],
        ['What is 2024 in Roman numerals?','2024 = MMXXIV. Breaking it down: MM=2000, XX=20, IV=4.'],
        ['What is 50 in Roman numerals?','50 = L. The letter L represents 50 in Roman numerals.'],
