        ['How to write 1 to 100 in Roman numerals?','The key milestone values are: I=1, V=5, X=10, L=50, C=100. Using subtractive notation (IV=4, IX=9, XL=40, XC=90) you can build any number 1 to 100. Our complete chart above shows every value.'],
